# Migration safety

Read `docs/migrations.md` before applying or resolving migrations.

- Use Prisma migrate only. Do not add an avsworklog-style ledger or print `DATABASE_URL`.
- Snapshot existing databases before `migrate resolve --applied`. Unexpected drift must be zero. Known leftover snake_case tables on hosted production are documented in `docs/migrations.md` and are not a reason to drop data.
- Do not route migration failures through generic finalise repair. Finalise must not migrate.
